OL,3,GNEWSAManic Street Preachers frontman   
OL,4,Afeels 'more pressure' playing in Wales 
OL,6,FHe said when the band wrote the album, 
OL,7,Fwhich sold 250,000 copies worldwide    
OL,8,Fupon its release, they were "a bit     
OL,9,Funreasonable and a bit mad" but also   
OL,10,F"fiercely ambitious".                  
